# Script:      labour-supply-dists-census-data.R
# Stage:       Census distribution build
# Runs after:  after Census labour-supply export load
# Key inputs:  filtered/unfiltered Census workbook; lookups
# Key outputs: Labour_Supply_Distribution_Stat_Can
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Builds Census labour supply distributions for graduate-level credentials.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
#             Access, Citrix, and \alder\S52018$ are historical references only.
# ⚠️ NOTE: This combined file is a reference document; run source scripts through
