# ── PIPELINE POSITION ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Script:      02a-update-cred-non-dup.R
# Stage:       Program matching finalization
# Runs after:  after 02a APPSO/BGS/DACSO
# Key inputs:  Credential_Non_Dup; matching outputs; CIP lookups
# Key outputs: Credential_Non_Dup with FINAL_CIP fields
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Applies final CIP and cluster assignments to deduplicated credentials.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
#             Access, Citrix, and \alder\S52018$ are historical references only.
