# Runs after:  after 02a final CIP updates
# Key inputs:  Student Outcomes cohort tables and lookups
# Key outputs: T_Cohorts_Recoded
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Builds the combined Student Outcomes cohort base.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
#             Access, Citrix, and \alder\S52018$ are historical references only.
