# Key inputs:  cohort data; NOC lookups; Census fallback
# Key outputs: occupation distribution tables
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Creates occupation distributions for later occupation projections.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
#             Access, Citrix, and \alder\S52018$ are historical references only.
