# ==============================================================================
# FILE: 04-graduate-projections.R
# ==============================================================================
# ── PIPELINE POSITION ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Script:      04-graduate-projections.R
# Stage:       Model step 04
# Runs after:  after 03
# Key inputs:  Credential_Non_Dup; population projections; enrolment summaries
# Key outputs: graduate projection tables
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Forecasts future credentials by credential, age, gender, field, and year.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
#             Access, Citrix, and \alder\S52018$ are historical references only.
# ⚠️ NOTE: This combined file is a reference document; run source scripts through
#          the orchestrator or documented sequence, not as one monolithic script.


