# Script:      zz-graduate-historical-forecasted.R
# Stage:       Ad hoc / validation
# Runs after:  only when specifically needed
# Key inputs:  final or intermediate model tables
# Key outputs: ad hoc extracts/checks
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Creates one-off outputs outside the standard annual production path.
# 📌 CONTEXT: Current PSSM processing uses R, SQL Server on decimal, and LAN files.
